  "description": "Muunilinst (pronounced \"MYOON-il-ist\", with a silent \"n\" near the end in Galactic Basic), nicknamed Moneylend, was the temperate, mineral-rich planet that was the homeworld of the Muun species and headquarters of the InterGalactic Banking Clan, which maintained a subdivision on-world. It was located on the Braxant Run. It was a member of the Confederacy of Independent Systems under Chairman San Hill.",
  "lead_paragraphs": [
    "Muunilinst (pronounced \"MYOON-il-ist\", with a silent \"n\" near the end in Galactic Basic), nicknamed Moneylend, was the temperate, mineral-rich planet that was the homeworld of the Muun species and headquarters of the InterGalactic Banking Clan, which maintained a subdivision on-world. It was located on the Braxant Run. It was a member of the Confederacy of Independent Systems under Chairman San Hill."
